  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/aias#hasFunction">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#AISystem"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/aias#Function"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates an AI system to a function it carries out, whichever subdomain the function comes from.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Verbindet ein KI-System mit einer Funktion, die es ausführt, aus welchem Teilbereich sie auch stammt.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has function</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="de">hat Funktion</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#ProcessOperator">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/aias#Function"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/aias#ExternalCloud">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/aias#Resource"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Flexibel skalierbare Rechenressourcen außerhalb des Anlagen- oder Unternehmensnetzes, deren Zugriff typischerweise ein externes Netzwerk, etwa eine Internetverbindung, erfordert.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Flexibly scalable computing resources outside the plant or company network, reaching which typically requires an external network such as an internet connection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">External Cloud</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="de">Externe Cloud</rdfs:label>
    <skos:note xml:lang="en">A function running here leaves the organisation, which is what separates it from the internal cloud.</skos:note>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/aias#hasOutputCommunication">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/aias#Component"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Communication"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Beschreibt eine unidirektionale Nutzung als Sender.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Describes a unidirectional use as a sender.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has output communication</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="de">hat ausgehende Kommunikation</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/fundedBy">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/aias#Relation">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Beschreibt strukturierte Beziehungen und Abhängigkeiten zwischen Funktionen und Komponenten.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Describes structured relationships and dependencies between functions and components.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="de">Relation</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Relation</rdfs:label>
    <skos:note xml:lang="en">A construct of this work, following the system elements of Haberfellner.

Three specialisations concretise it, each taken from a subdomain pattern: the assignment and the flow of VDI 3682, and the communication of ISO/IEC 7498-1. Relations are classes rather than object properties so that a model can annotate one: an assignment is a thing, not an arrow.</skos:note>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/aias#Function">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Beschreibt Transformationen, durch die Eingaben in Ausgaben überführt werden, um Systemziele zu erreichen.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Describes transformations by which inputs are turned into outputs in order to reach the objectives of a system.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Function</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="de">Funktion</rdfs:label>
    <skos:note xml:lang="en">A construct of this work, following the system elements of Haberfellner et al., Systems Engineering, Springer 2019. The notion of a function is the general one of a purposeful transformation.

Without this class a process operator of VDI 3682 and an inference of ISO/IEC 22989 are unrelated things, and nothing can be said about both at once. Under one superclass they become comparable and are treated by the same mechanisms, above all the assignment to a component.</skos:note>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/title">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/aias#hasRelation">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#AISystem"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/aias#Relation"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates an AI system to a tie between its functions and its components.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Verbindet ein KI-System mit einer Verbindung zwischen seinen Funktionen und Komponenten.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has relation</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="de">hat Relation</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N5eedd642b73544edade9f388608000a3">
